{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "washtenaw-county-starts",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.41, step 7f: the SINGLE-county input database of `process-crankcase-start-single`, as the onroad chain mounts it -- `washtenaw_cdb` as `characterization/county-inputs/washtenaw-county/setup-starts.sql` builds it. It is `inputs/washtenaw-county-hotelling.esm`'s database with the hotelling rows taken out and one table put in: the same literal `state`, `county`, `zone` and `zoneRoadType` (allocation factors truncated to twelve decimals), `year` and `sourceTypeYear`; `roadTypeDistribution` for source type 21 instead of 62, identical to the default's; the five hotelling tables created EMPTY, because MOVES's startup check wants them to exist; the same `INSERT ... SELECT` copies of the default's age distribution, VMT and fuel supply, REPLACED at SINGLE scale and identical at every key read; and `startsPerDay`, 2 rows for source type 21, which are the default's own sourceTypePopulation x startsPerDayPerVehicle (387,305,498 weekday, 329,110,808 weekend).\n\nTHE MERGE, as the hotelling database's document records it table by table: `zone` and `zoneRoadType` SHADOW the default's rows (declared as `db_input_zone` and `db_input_zoneroadtype`; the zone's startAllocFactor is what scales starts), `startsPerDay` merges over an empty default side (declared whole), the hotelling tables are empty here and the default's `hotellingActivityDistribution` is merged untouched, and everything else is the default's.\n\nIT DOES NOT LOAD ALONE: it names no runspec.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "onroad",
      "domain",
      "single-county-domain",
      "scale-input-database"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_link": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../movesdb/Link.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_link"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope",
          "output",
          "domain"
        ],
        "note": "Link, the default database's national table: MOVES merges it into every domain but PROJECT (InputDataManager.java:1432), so a SINGLE-county run reads the same 22,610 synthetic links a DEFAULT one does, and selects county 26161's on-network and off-network ones by its joins.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_linksourcetypehour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../movesdb/linkSourceTypeHour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_linksourcetypehour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "activity"
        ],
        "note": "linkSourceTypeHour, the default database's: 0 rows, and the county database has none. Only ProjectTAG reads it.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecdomain": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-county-starts/runspecdomain.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecdomain"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope",
          "domain"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, modelDomain SINGLE, read by tools/build-scale-input-db.py from the RunSpec XML's `<modeldomain value=\"SINGLE\"/>` -- ModelDomain.java's SINGLE_COUNTY.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_input_zoneroadtype": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-county-starts/ZoneRoadType.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_inputzoneroadtype"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "activity"
        ],
        "note": "The county's ZoneRoadType: 4 rows at zone 261610, the default's values truncated to twelve decimals; the input side of a row merge. Starts read no road type's allocation factor.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_input_hotellingactivitydistribution": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-county-starts/hotellingActivityDistribution.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_inputhotellingactivitydistribution"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "hotelling"
        ],
        "note": "Created empty: 0 rows. The default's 36 rows at 990000 merge untouched.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_hotellinghoursperday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-county-starts/hotellingHoursPerDay.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_hotellinghoursperday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "hotelling"
        ],
        "note": "Created empty: 0 rows.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_hotellinghourfraction": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-county-starts/hotellingHourFraction.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
